- crates/jig-vault/src/store.rs;
- crates/jig-vault/src/vault_tests/lifecycle.rs;
- backup and restore controls exposed by the Jig CLI/TUI.

Reuse no-overwrite, private staging, tamper cleanup, permissions, symlink/hard-link refusal, audit verification, publication-failure, and legacy-backup cases. Replace the v2 backup payload, vault-wide passphrase/DEK recovery, single-target transaction model, and any restore that mutates an existing destination.

